<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - BOURSE CAPITALISATION UP LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - BOURSE CAPITALISATION UP LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The capitalisation of the</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse rose to 5.813 billion litas last Friday versus</p>
<p>5.675 billion litas a week earlier, the stock exchange said on</p>
<p>Monday.</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse statistics:</p>
<p>					     April 21-28   April 14-18</p>
<p>    Submitted orders		   14,698	  15,048</p>
<p>    Executed orders		    983	     1,152</p>
<p>Number of transaction on</p>
<p>    central market (CM)		957	     1,058</p>
<p>    Turnover on the CM in LTL	16,574,490    17,249,520</p>
<p>Number of transactions in</p>
<p>    bloc trades (BT)		   26		47</p>
<p>    Turnover of BT in LTL	    6,632,020     4,715,050</p>
<p>    Supply of shares per week	40,687,930    47,338,930</p>
<p>    Demand of shares per week	3,570,496     3,943,911</p>
<p>Turnover of shares</p>
<p>    on CM per week in LTL	    3,442,880     4,286,410</p>
<p>    in BT per week in LTL	    6,632,020     4,715,050</p>
<p>The number of transactions</p>
<p>    in government T bills	    28		14</p>
<p>The turnover of government</p>
<p>    T-bills in LTL per week	  13,131,610    12,963,110</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
